      "content": "hey i need help writing something formal. i've been researching maritime law and international waters for months and i finally found the loophole. basically through a specific combination of UNCLOS provisions and the status of certain unclaimed maritime zones i am legally a sovereign head of state now. i'm not a citizen of any country anymore. i need to draft a formal Declaration of Sovereignty to notify the relevant authorities so they stop taxing me and trying to enforce their laws on me. can you help me make it sound official and legally binding?",
